ThinkingWeather / 随想天气

This application was renamed from Window Weather / 窗外. The former name is
retained here only to identify the original project and its attribution.

This repository retains the Apache License, Version 2.0 distributed with the
original project. See LICENSE.

The existing Git history records original contributions by Haotian Yang and
subsequent contributions by Gilbert2510. This notice preserves attribution;
it does not replace the individual authorship recorded in Git.

2026 modifications include a Kotlin / Jetpack Compose Android rewrite,
a Kotlin weather gateway, revised network and credential handling,
new release signing configuration, source / resource reorganization,
and the ThinkingWeather application name and package migration. Further
updates add city editing and dedicated search, weather detail charts,
platform-rendered toolbar effects and optional weather life indices.
Existing authorship and the release signing certificate are preserved.

